phans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;2023年４月10日開催の取締役会決議による第８回新株予約権&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;新株予約権の数　46,154個&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;普通株式　4,615,400株）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:3pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;font-size:10pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesPerShareInformationConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesSignificantEventsAfterReportingPeriodConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p style="page-break-before:always; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;"&gt;(重要な後発事象)&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;h6 class="smt_head5" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（第８回新株予約権の行使による増資）&lt;/h6&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　2024年４月25日に第８回新株予約権の全部が権利行使されました。当該新株予約権の行使により発行した株式の概要は以下のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:371.3pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:211.5pt;min-width:211.5pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:159.8pt;min-width:159.8pt;"/&gt;
